COMMENT ON COLUMN __mj."CommunicationProvider"."DeliveryGuarantee" IS 'What happens when a send''s outcome is unknown (the provider may have accepted it, but the result was never recorded). At Most Once: never resend; the message is reported as Failed with OutcomeUnknown, so a recipient may miss it. At Least Once: resend; a recipient may get it twice. Default for every send through this provider.';

